WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.980
Preparing an ET1 means pulling names, dates,

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:06.760
pay and claim details from several documents,

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.160
then entering them into the form by hand.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:15.000
With Lylo, upload the matter documents and the ET1 starts building itself from the evidence.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.860
The official form fills live, and every section shows what is complete and what still needs attention.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.420
If something cannot be established from the documents, Lylo does not guess.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.680
It takes you straight to the gap for review.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:31.540
Here, the missing ACAS number is supplied by the solicitor,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.940
written into the ET1, and explicitly confirmed before finalising.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.980
Every answer keeps its source.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.180
Open Sources to see the document, page and evidence behind the field.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.260
And the solicitor stays in control.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.700
You can edit any field directly, just like a normal document,

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.460
or simply ask Lylo to make the change for you.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.720
Either way, the ET1 updates immediately and important changes remain reviewable.

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:01.880
Once everything is resolved, Lylo prepares a clean ET1, ready for the solicitor’s final check.
